<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for reaching out to the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If lost/stolen item use</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear about your missing <em><strong>&lt;ITEM&gt;</strong></em> on board QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that as soon as you reported the item as missing, we carried out a thorough search. On this occasion, we haven’t found any trace of your <em><strong>&lt;ITEM&gt;</strong></em>.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If damaged item use</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Safeguarding your belongings</strong><br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear about the damage to your <em><strong>&lt;ITEM&gt;</strong></em> while you were on board QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
While we take all possible care to help you look after any belongings you carry on your flights or through our airports, your bags remain your responsibility<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If requesting compensation add</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>We’re here to help</strong><br />
<br />
As the <em><strong>&lt;ITEM&gt;</strong></em> was in your care, we’re unable to meet your request for compensation this time.<br />
<br />
While I understand this is not the outcome you wanted, we can send you any additional information you need to complete a travel insurance claim, as they may cover these sorts of situations. &nbsp;</p>
